  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759370,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 12-Sai. Honto no Kimochi (Nintendo 3DS) - Synopsis\n\nExperience the awkward and endearing journey of Ayase Hanabi in *12-Sai. Honto no Kimochi* for Nintendo 3DS! Based on Nao Maita’s popular manga, this visual novel explores the complexities of adolescence through the eyes of a relatable 12-year-old girl. \n\nNavigate Ayase’s daily life as she grapples with school, budding friendships, and the confusing stirrings of first love. The game features multiple storylines and endings, shaped by your choices and interactions with a cast of charming characters.  Discover Ayase’s inner thoughts and feelings through beautifully illustrated scenes and heartfelt dialogue. \n\n*12-Sai. Honto no Kimochi* utilizes the 3DS’s touch screen for intuitive interactions and allows players to uncover hidden details and deepen relationships.  Explore themes of self-discovery, acceptance, and the bittersweet nature of growing up in this charming and emotionally resonant adventure.  Will you help Ayase navigate the challenges of puberty and find her place in the world?"
    },
